        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu enu atupristu, lushimbi ilu Iwenwenu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamazaza nindi, Neyi kwonti kwenu kushaku muchima, neyi kwonti kwenu kulemesha ijina dami, komana ami nukuyikunkwila ishiŋu, nukushiŋa ninkisu jenu, eŋa, najishiŋa dehi kwami, nanochu chimwabulaŋa kushaku muchima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, nukutamisha mbutu jenu hansaŋu jenu, nukuyimwaŋila tuji kumesu enu, twotuji twayimuna yenu yimwaketulaŋa, akayifumishila kumu ninenu aweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakeluki nenu, Nayitemesheli dehi lushimbi ilu kulonda chitiyaŋenu chami chakekali naLevi. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova wamazaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chitiyaŋenu chami chinatiyaŋeni nindi, chadiŋi chawumi nakuwunda; namwinkelaŋu nami atiyi woma, ninodu wantiyili woma, hakwakama niijina dami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukanwa kindi kwadiŋi nshimbi jansaŋu yalala, kunyivumbu yindi hikwamwekeni kuheŋaku; nendeli nindi mukuwunda nakwoloka, wabalumwini antu amavulu aleka nikuluwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyivumbu yakapristu chiŋa yihembaŋa maana, antu chiŋa ehulaŋa nshimbi kukanwa kindi; muloŋa yena diyi ntemesha yaYehova wamazaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa enu munasenuki munjila, munadimbwishi antu amavulu munshimbi; munatamishi chitiyaŋenu chaLevi. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova wamazaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimunabuli kulama njila jami, nichimunaakami antu kumesu awu nansaŋu janshimbi, dichi chinayibalumuni dehi kwikala antu adiwulewa, akadi kulema, kumesu awantu ejima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wejima wetu hitukweti tata yetu yowumuku? Hiyatuleŋeli kudi Nzambi yowumuku? Indi twadikwatilaŋadi makasu dinu, iwu nakukwatila mana kwindi makasu, iwu nakukwatila mana kwindi makasu, hitukujilola chitiyaŋenu chawankakulula jetu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda nakwatili akwawu makasu, anashimani dehi nimuIsarela nimuYerusalema; Yuda najiloli dehi kujila kwaYehova kwakeŋa eliyi, nasumbuli dehi mwana kamukishi wakwacheŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wukufumisha mumatenti aYakoba iyala wakoŋaŋa chumichi, hela himukwakukonkama, hela himukwakwakula, hela himukwakulambula Yehova wamazaza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu nawa cheŋi chimwelaŋa, mwabutaŋa kameŋa kaYehova namadilu, nakudila, nakwaboka, mwaka enzi abuli kwitŋia cheŋi himulambu wenu, mwaka enzi abuli kutiya kuwaha kuwutambula kuchikasa chenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, enu nenu, Wukulekeladi? Muloŋa Nzambi neli dehi chinsahu chahakachi keyi naŋodeyi wahawukwenzi weyi iwuna mukwatili makasu, kutoŋa diyi mukwenu wadikata nindi, kutoŋa diyi iŋodeyi wachitiyaŋenu chiwatiyaŋeni nindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haleŋeli wumuku? Yena diyi wadiŋi nayaspiritu yashalaku. Ochu wumu wanka? Walondeli anyana akudi Nzambi. Dichi babelenu nyichima yenu, bayi hamwekana muntu wukukwatila Iŋodindi wahawukwenzi windi makasuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova, Nzambi yaIsarela, nahoshi nindi, Nsaŋu jakuseŋaŋana najitiya kutama nankashi, nahelaŋa nimuntu wajikaŋa madombu nehina dindi. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Yehova wamazaza. Dichi babelenu nyichima yenu, kulonda mubuli kukwatila aŋodi jenu makasu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munamuzeyeshi Yehova namazu enu. Enu nenu, Tunamuzeyeshi hadihi? Nachina chimwahoshaŋa nenu, Antu ejima ahoshaŋa chatama anawahi kumesu aYehova; nenu, Diwu anatiyiyi kuwaha; hela chimwahoshaŋa nenu, Nzambi yawaŋaji wudi kudihi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
